From 74782d76a21bdf4b2d736fa6b4cd127bd46556e1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 11:26:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 266/267] media: amlogic: amvdec: add VC-1 decoding

Add stateless VC-1 (Simple, Main and Advanced profile) decoding up to
1920x1088 on VDEC_1 for GXBB to SM1 with the open amrisc-vdec VC-1
firmware (amrisc/amrisc_vc1.bin).

Send each picture, or each field of a field pair, as one command block
built from the controls, with the input copied to a window of its own,
and restart the processor for every command. Complete a picture that
fails or times out with an error and reload the firmware.

Range-reduced and resized (RESPIC) pictures are refused.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Christian Hewitt <christianshewitt@gmail.com>
